{"id":"a2e45aeae7b65467","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-functional-perfect-embedding.md","title":"处处分裂的有限输出产生可计算完美嵌入","display":"lem-functional-perfect-embedding — 处处分裂的有限输出产生可计算完美嵌入","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-functional-perfect-embedding","aliases":["20-lem-functional-perfect-embedding"],"display":"lem-functional-perfect-embedding — 处处分裂的有限输出产生可计算完美嵌入","chapter":"9","section":"9.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 9.6.1 证明中 Case 2 的完美嵌入论证","source_printed_pages":[180,181],"source_pdf_pages":[212,213],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-df-use]]","[[20-df-tree]]","[[20-df-computable-tree-embedding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-functional-perfect-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-functional-perfect-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-functional-perfect-embedding — 处处分裂的有限输出产生可计算完美嵌入"},{"key":"chapter","html":"9"},{"key":"section","html":"9.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 9.6.1 证明中 Case 2 的完美嵌入论证"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>180</span><span>181</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>212</span><span>213</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ecb9f43e837dcf35\" href=\"?note=ecb9f43e837dcf35\" title=\"20-df-computable-tree-embedding\">20-df-computable-tree-embedding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。\n有限 oracle 的输出初段关系采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；假设：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall\\alpha,\\eta\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[(\\tau\\preceq\\alpha\\land\\Phi_e^\\alpha\\succeq\\eta)\\Rightarrow\\eta\\in T],\\\\\n\\forall\\rho\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\tau\\preceq\\rho\\Rightarrow\n\\exists\\alpha,\\beta,\\eta,\\nu\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n(\\rho\\preceq\\alpha\\land\\rho\\preceq\\beta\\land\\eta\\perp\\nu\n\\land\\Phi_e^\\alpha\\succeq\\eta\\land\\Phi_e^\\beta\\succeq\\nu)].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall\\alpha,\\eta\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[(\\tau\\preceq\\alpha\\land\\Phi_e^\\alpha\\succeq\\eta)\\Rightarrow\\eta\\in T],\\\\\n\\forall\\rho\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\tau\\preceq\\rho\\Rightarrow\n\\exists\\alpha,\\beta,\\eta,\\nu\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n(\\rho\\preceq\\alpha\\land\\rho\\preceq\\beta\\land\\eta\\perp\\nu\n\\land\\Phi_e^\\alpha\\succeq\\eta\\land\\Phi_e^\\beta\\succeq\\nu)].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ecb9f43e837dcf35\" href=\"?note=ecb9f43e837dcf35\" title=\"20-df-computable-tree-embedding\">20-df-computable-tree-embedding</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}functional-perfect-embedding}\\vdash\n\\exists g:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to T\\ [\\operatorname{PerfectEmbed}(g,T)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}functional-perfect-embedding}\\vdash\n\\exists g:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to T\\ [\\operatorname{PerfectEmbed}(g,T)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同步递归构造有限输入树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 和输出树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>。根取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(\\varnothing)=\\tau\">\\(h(\\varnothing)=\\tau\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(\\varnothing)=\\varnothing\">\\(g(\\varnothing)=\\varnothing\\)</span>；空输出的前提保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\in T\">\\(\\varnothing\\in T\\)</span>。已有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(\\sigma),g(\\sigma)\">\\(h(\\sigma),g(\\sigma)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^{h(\\sigma)}\\succeq g(\\sigma)\">\\(\\Phi_e^{h(\\sigma)}\\succeq g(\\sigma)\\)</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(\\sigma)\">\\(h(\\sigma)\\)</span> 以上有效搜索一对不相容有限二进制输出，并要求两者延长 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(\\sigma)\">\\(g(\\sigma)\\)</span>。处处分裂保证搜索终止：前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(\\sigma)\">\\(g(\\sigma)\\)</span> 的计算对所有输入延长不变，故任一不相容输出对的分歧都发生在它之后，两支均严格延长该前缀。</p>\n<p>把输入见证设为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(\\sigma^\\frown0),h(\\sigma^\\frown1)\">\\(h(\\sigma^\\frown0),h(\\sigma^\\frown1)\\)</span>，输出见证设为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(\\sigma^\\frown0),g(\\sigma^\\frown1)\">\\(g(\\sigma^\\frown0),g(\\sigma^\\frown1)\\)</span>。各值都在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，兄弟不相容，路径上严格增长，后代保留前缀。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\preceq\\rho\\iff g(\\sigma)\\preceq g(\\rho)\">\\(\\sigma\\preceq\\rho\\iff g(\\sigma)\\preceq g(\\rho)\\)</span>；任意给定域串只需有限次终止搜索，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 全可计算并满足 PerfectEmbed。这里查询的是实际父输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(\\sigma)\">\\(h(\\sigma)\\)</span> 以上的分裂，输出与输入树分别维护，不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^{h(\\sigma)}\">\\(\\Phi_e^{h(\\sigma)}\\)</span> 当成已全定义的无限函数。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 180–181 / PDF 212–213。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-use]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","exc